From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Petar Kirov <petar.p.kirov@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:42:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [libc++] Provide the default rune table for WASI again

The locale base API moved _LIBCPP_PROVIDES_DEFAULT_RUNE_TABLE from
__config into each platform's support header, but the fallback path that
WASI (and NuttX) take never defined it, so ctype_base found no mask table
for them: libc++ for wasm32-wasip1 failed with `space`, `print`, ...
undeclared in ctype_base.h. The fallback defines it as __cxx03/__config
did for those platforms.
---
 libcxx/include/__locale_dir/locale_base_api.h | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libcxx/include/__locale_dir/locale_base_api.h b/libcxx/include/__locale_dir/locale_base_api.h
index bd0391e322..2e62811705 100644
--- a/libcxx/include/__locale_dir/locale_base_api.h
+++ b/libcxx/include/__locale_dir/locale_base_api.h
@@ -140,6 +140,15 @@
 #      include <__locale_dir/locale_base_api/ibm.h>
 #    endif
 
+// The platforms on this path whose C library has no ctype rune table of its
+// own, as __cxx03/__config lists them; the others define it in their support
+// header.
+#    if defined(__wasi__) || defined(__NuttX__)
+#      define _LIBCPP_PROVIDES_DEFAULT_RUNE_TABLE 1
+#    else
+#      define _LIBCPP_PROVIDES_DEFAULT_RUNE_TABLE 0
+#    endif
+
 #    include <__locale_dir/locale_base_api/bsd_locale_fallbacks.h>
 
 #    include <__cstddef/size_t.h>
